<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya ivili lya Paulo kwa Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya ivili lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoseo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba hai lya Timoseo lya ivili ni lihamba gha ivili kuhuma kwa mndumindumi Paulo akimyandikila Timoseo mvulwa ghaki. Timoseo wa ivili kiyandikilwi lipindi lya pabehi na mwihu wa ukomu wa kulama Mndumindumi Paulo. Lipindi hali awelili kawopwa kulighuta lya wawopwa haku mmbwani mkulunga wa Loma. Hai inguhuma ku 2Tim 1:16. Paulo awelili na ughanja handa mlongo na Timoseo na miyanja itangala amkemili handa mwana ghaki hai inguhuma ku Filipu 2:22, 1Tim 1:2, 1Tim 1:18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hai ni imonga gha lihamba njechi kuhuma kwa Paulo zila kamuyandikila mundu badili gha lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. lihamba ghangi itatu ni 1Tim na Titusi na Filemoni. Paayandika Timoseo wa ivili, wakilisito kuunkosi wa Loma wawelili wanguhakilwa kwaikiva gha ukwinila ghao. Hai ndiwa inguwesa kuwela njila gha Paulo kuwela muuwopwa na kumlaghila Timoseo afumilili mahakilo. Kulimba lya mtumbulo kwa Timoseo, Paulo ampeghili Timoseo makaniso yatangala kwa wavula wavulili uhwangi. 1Tim 1:16-18. Hilahila amlongelili Timoseo kutevile na lipindi lya mahakilo kuulongolo 3:1</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula kwa kumjambusa Timoseo 1:1-2 na angumtaya moyu 1:3-18</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumlongela Timoseo afumilili mahakilo 2:1-13</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumpegha Timoseo malaghililo hyogha kwa pamonga 2:14-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumkanisa kwa ghala yatehumila kuulongolo na ghala angupalwa kughola payahumila. 3:1-4:8</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyomola kwa kumlaghila malaghilo ghaki mweni Timoseo 4:9-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nenga Paulo, avile Sapanga apalili nivile mndumindumi wa Kilisito Yesu ili niulongeli hula ukomu tulaghililwi kwa kukonganika na Kilisito Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />nakuyandikila wenga mwana ghangu mpalwa Timoseo. Ningukutakila manemu, luhungu na kulikala kwa kukotoho kutovana kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati na Kilisito Yesu Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushukwile na milando gha kutaya moyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga yula ningumtumikila kwa uchakaka handa wagholili wagogolo wa nenga, namshukwile Sapanga kila paningumbwiki kukuyupila uhiku na pamuhi. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ningukumbwike masosi ghako na ningupala nesu kukulola, ili niweli na luheku nesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ningukumbwike ukwinila ghako gha uchakaka, ukwinila awelili nau mnahota ghako Loisi, na kangi nyongo ghako Unisi. Ningumanya kwa uchakaka yiwa na wenga kangi uvile nayu. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Kwaikiva hai ningukukumbusa uyimusi hila hupo gha Sapanga upokelili panivika mawoku kumutu ghako. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Kwaikiva Mpumulo atupeghili Sapanga ng'ogha wa kutughola tuweli wandu wa kutila, ila wa makakala na upalo na moyu wa kulilongosa mweni. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Kwa nagha ukotoho kulola honi kumtangasa Bambu wa twenga, na ukotoho kulihola honi kwaikiva gha nenga nivile muuwopwa kwaikiva gha mweni. Ila utoli fwasi ghako na nenga kumahakili gha Habali Maha, kwa hula uweso akupeghili Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Sapanga atulokolili na kutuhaghula tuweli wandu wa weka, ng'ogha kwaikiva tugholili maha, ila agholili nagha kwaikiva gha lukani lwaki na manemu ghaki. Atupeghili manemu hagha kwaikiva gha Kilisito Yesu pambila gha kuwela kwa mlima wogha, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />ila hinaa ihighiliswa kwa mweni mlokola wa twenga, Kilisito Yesu. avile aghalambulili kuhova na kuyegha ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela na kuhova ng'ogha kwa kupitila Habali Maha. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nenga nihaghulilwi nivile mndumindumi na mvula kwaikiva gha kutangasa Habali Maha, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />na nenga ninguhakilwa kwaikiva gha mighalu hagha, ila nilolili ng'ogha honi kwaikiva ningummanya yula nimkwinilili, nivile na uchakaka atewesa kukigholokela kila anipeghili, mbaka lichuwa lila lya kuhika kwa mweni. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Ukoli kwa umaha mavulo yala gha chakaka nikuvulili. Na kuhighala kuukwinila na upalo wa twenga kwa kukongana na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Ugholokeli ujumbi wauchakaka upeghilwi na Mpumulo wa Sapanga yula angutama mghati mwa twenga. <verse eid="2TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Handa ungumanya, wandu wogha mmbwani Asia wanileka, wamonga ghao ni Fegelo na Helimogeni. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Ningumyupa Bambu awawoneli luhungu wandu wa Onesifolo, kwaikiva kanitaya moyu miyanja itangala, kangi alolili ng'ogha honi kuhika kunilola paniwelili kuuwopwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Paahikili Loma, anihakulili nesu mbaka akanilola. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Ninguyupa Bambu amuwoneli luhungu lichuwa lila! Na wenga ungumanya vila anitumikila haku ku Efesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Mtovangondo wamaha wa Kilisito Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Hinu, wenga mwana ghangu, uvile na makakala kumanemu ivile mghati mwa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Uniyoghanila yala niyavulili kuulongolo gha wandu. Hinaa ningukupala uwalongeli mighalu haghahagha wakwinila waghangi wala wanguwesa kuwavula wandu waghangi hilahila. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Utoli fwasi ghako kumahakilo handa mtovangondo maha wa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Mtovangondo kungondu angujilekanisa na mighalu gha panji gha ngondu, ili awesi kumhekelesa mkulu ghaki. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Hila hila hata mtulambilo yoyose awesa ng'ogha kusinda na kupokela hupo gha usindi ikiva atekovekela ng'ogha malaghililo. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mtukutula yula agholili lihengu likamala angupalwa kupokela mahala gha mtumbulo gha mabeno. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Uyawachilili hagha ninguyalongela, kwaikiva Bambu atekuwesesa umanyi kila kindu. <verse eid="2TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Mkumbwike Yesu Kilisito ahindulilwi kuhuma kukihu, yula awelili wa ukolu wa Daudi, handa ingulonga Habali Maha hai niitangasa, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />na kwaikiva gha nagha nahakilwa na niwopilwa minyololu handa mhakata. Ila lilando lya Sapanga liwesa ng'ogha kuwopwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Kwa nagha ningufumilila mighalu hyogha kwaikiva gha waghaghulwa wa Sapanga, lukuni na weni hilahila wapati kulokoka kupitila kwa Yesu Kilisito na ukwilikihi wa machuwa yayendelela. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Ulongela hau ni chakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Ikiva tuhovili pamonga na mweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">kangi tutelikala pamonga na mweni.” <verse eid="2TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Handa tukiyendelela kufumilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">kangi tutelongosa hilahila pamonga na mweni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Handa tutemkanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">na mweni hilahila atetukanila. <verse eid="2TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Handa tukwinila ng'ogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">mweni ateyendelela kukwinilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">Kwaikiva mweni kawesa ng'ogha kujikanila mweni.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mghola lihengu yula kajumilwa na Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Hinu uwakumbusi wandu ghako mighalu hai na kuwakanisa kuulongolo gha Sapanga waleki kusindana kwa milando ivile ng'ogha gha maha. Kusindana haku kwa milando kwamaha ng'ogha, ila kunguyegha ukolonganyo kwa wala wanguyoghanila. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Uyangalai nesu kughola maha ili upati kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga handa mghola lihengu awesili ng'ogha kuwela na honi akivula kwa kiuchakaka ujumbi wa uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Ulikali kutali na malongelano yamyinula ng'ogha Sapanga. Kwaikiva itewaghola wandu wayendeleli kumkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Mavulo ghao yatelandala handa lilonda mbama, na amonga gha wala wavulili hagha ni Humenayo na Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Ikiva wauleka uchakaka na wangulonga yiwa uhinduko uhumila kala na wangukologhanya ukwinila wa wandu ghangi. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ila kitamilo kivikwa na Sapanga kiwesa ng'ogha kuhukumulwa kigangamala na kiyandikwa milando hai, “Bambu angumanya wandu ghaki wogha" na hila hila "wogha wavile wa Bambu wangupalwa waleki mahakata.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Hinu kulighuta lya mweni vindu ngoo kuvile na mabakuli na vyombu vya kila mtindu; vyombu vya zahabu na feza, vyombu vya mindakali na mibiki. Na vyombu vighangi kutumila kwa kutundamilwa na vighangi ng'ogha. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Hinu mundu pakalighulula kwa kulikala kutali na mighalu hagha mihakata, atewela kyombu kya kutundamilwa, kwaikiva kalivika kala kwa Bambu ghaki na kuliyandala kughola kila lihengu maha. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Jiviki kutali na lumatamata lihakata lwa usongolo, ukovekeli njila maha, na ukwinila, na upalo, na kukotoho kutovana, na pamonga na wandu wogha wangumyupa Bambu kwa moyu maha. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Uleki ndyangilo gha milando gha utatala iwesa ng'ogha kumtundamilisa Sapanga na gha kisiisii, ungumanya yiwa hagha yanguyegha mikologhanyiko. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Kangi ingupalwa ng'ogha mtumikila wa Bambu kuwela na makologhanyiko. Aweli mnyalinyali paanguvula, na mfumilifu kwa wandu wogha, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />kangi ingumpala kuwalongela kwa unyalinyali wala wangusindana na mweni, ili ikiwesekana Sapanga awapeghi lipindi lya kuleka sambi na kuumanya uchakaka, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />kwa nagha luhala lwa weni lutewahuyila kangi, ili wahuki kumtegho wa Lihyukana hula awelili kawategha na kuwaghola wagholi mighalu ghaki.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Machuwa gha mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Umanyi yiwa, kumachuwa gha mwihu kutevile na lipindi lya lung'ai. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Wandu watelipala wenibaha na weni lumatamata lya mapesa, weni kujiyinula, na weni kinyengu, na weni kulighu, na weni kuwatundamila ng'ogha walela ghao, na wavile ng'ogha na kushukwile, na wahaghulwa ng'ogha kwaikiva gha Sapanga, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />wavile ng'ogha na upalo, na wapala ng'ogha kulekesela, na wabaisila, na weni kubaka ng'ogha na lumatamata lwao, na wakalipa na wapala ng'ogha ghala gha maha, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />weni kuhyuka, na wandu weni lilaka lya pabehi, na wamemeswa na kuliyinula, na weni kupala mawamba kupiti kumpala Sapanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Wandu hagha kwa panji watewoneka handa wandu wa kumtundamila Sapanga, ila wangukingama uweso ghaki. Ulikali kutali nesu na weni. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Wamonga ghao wanguyenda kumaghuta gha wandu na kuwatola kwa kuwakwegha kwa kuwangonga wadala wavile na makakala ng'ogha kumpumulo na weni mihighu gha sambi na wangulongoswa na kila mitindu gha lumatamata lihakata, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />wadala hagha wanguyangala kujivula machuwa hyogha ila wawesa ng'ogha kuhikila kumanyi uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Wandu hagha huukingama uchakaka handa vila Yane na Yambile vila wamkingama Musa. Hagha ni wandu wa luhala libyodoka na waileka ukwinila wa chakaka. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ila wawesa ng'ogha kuyendelela nesu kwaikiva usihisihi wa weni utewoneka lupala kwa wogha, handa iwelili kwa Yane na Yambile.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malongelo gha mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ila wenga, uyamanya mavulo ghangu na kukovekela, na ndyangilo ghangu, na lukani lwangu, na ukwinila ghangu, na ufumilifu wa nenga, na upalo wa nenga, na kugangamala kwa nenga, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />na mahakilo na lughai. Yala yanihumilili nikiva ku Anitiokia, na ku Ikonia na ku Lisitila, mahakilo hyogha niyafumilili, ila Bambu anilokolili kuhagha hyogha. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Mundu yoyose atepala kulikala ngalilu gha kumtundamila Sapanga kupitila ku Kilisito Yesu atehakilwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Wandu wahakata na wahwaghi wateyendelela kuwela wahakata nesu, wakingonga waghangi, na weni wakingongwa hilahila. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ila wenga uyendeleli kulikala na yala uvulilwi na kuyakwinila nesu. Wawamanya wala wawelili wavula ghako, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />kangi kuhuma ununguna ghako ungumanya Mayandiko yala yanguwesa kukupatila luhala lukani ulokolwi kwa njila gha kumkwinila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Mayandiko hyogha yayandikwa kwa kulongoswa na Sapanga na yamaha kwa mavulo, na kukanisa wandu mahakili ghao, na kuwalongosa na kuwavula ku ndyangilo apalili Sapanga, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />ili mundu wa Sapanga aweli katimila, na kayandalwa kwa kughola kila lihengu maha.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Nakulaghila kuulongolo gha Sapanga, na kuulongolo gha Kilisito Yesu yula atewalamula wandu wavile wakomu na wahovili, na nakulaghila kwa kuhika kwaki na kwa unkosi ghaki, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />utangasi lilando lya Sapanga. Kwa lipindi lya maheli au lipindi lya maheli ng'ogha kwa njila gha ufumilifu, kalipila, na uwakanisi na kuwataya moyu na kwa mavulo maheli. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Kwaikiva kutehika lipindi wandu wateleka kuhyoghanila mavulo gha uchakaka, ila watekovekela lumatamata lyao wakilihakulila wavula watangala wa kuwavula mighalu hila wanguipala kuhyoghanila. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Watelema kuhyoghanila uchakaka, wateghalambukila luhumu luwachenga ng'ogha kuukwinila. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ila ungupalwa kuwela na mawachilo yamaha ku kila mghalu ghako wa utumikila. Ukotoho kutila kuhakilwa kwaikiva gha Bambu uwalongeli waghangi Habali Maha na kuyomola utumikila hula Sapanga akupeghili. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ningukulongela hagha kwaikiva nenga napabehi kuyeghwa handa litambiku lya kunyweghwa lingutaywa kukihanja. Hinaa lipindi lya kuhova nenga litimila kala. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Nitovanili ngondu maheli, na mwanja niyomola, na ukwinila niugholokela. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Hinaa nivikilwa kala hupo kwaikiva gha ngalilu gha umaha hula Bambu mtosa angutosa vila ipalilwi atenipegha hupo hai lichuwa lila, ila ng'ogha weka ghangu ila na wala wogha wangulindila kwa luhujulu kuhighiliswa kwaki.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Uyangalai kuhika kwa nenga kwa uloposelo, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />kwaikiva Dema aupalili mlima wogha hau akanileka na kuyenda zyaki kummbwani Tesaloniki. Kilesiki ayendili Galatia, na Titusi ayendili ku Dalimatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Ni Lukasi weka ghaki ndiwa kahighala baha pamonga na nenga. Mhakuli Maliku uhiki na mweni kwaikiva atewesa kunitanga kuutumikila ghangu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Nimlaghilili Tukiko kula Efesu. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Pautehika niyegheli likoti lyangu nililekili kwa Kalipo kula Tiloa, niyegheli hilahila vila vihitabu vya nenga nesu nesu vila vya kunyenga. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Yula Alekisandilia mghongola hindu vya feza kanigholela mahakata yatangala. Bambu atemhipa kukovekelana na hagha matendu ghaki. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Ulikali mihu na mweni kwaikiva akingamili nesu ujumbi wa twenga.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Panilitetela kwa lihanja lya mtumbulo kwahela hata mundu mmonga anitangili, wogha wanilekili. Sapanga akotoho kuwavalaghiha lihakata hali! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ila Bambu atamili pamonga na nenga, akanipegha makakala, hata nikawesa kuulongela ujumbi wogha, wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha wauyoghanile, kangi nikalokolwa kuhuma ku kihu. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Bambu atenilokola na mighalu hyogha mihakata, na kunitola maha mbaka kuunkosi ghaki wa kundumba. Kwa mweni uweli ukwilikihi machuwa yayendelela na kuyendelela! Yinaa.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majambuso gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Wajambusi Pilisila na Akula, pamonga na walongo wa Onesifolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasito ahighalile ku Kolinto, na mweni Tilofimo nimlekili ku Mileto kwaikiva awelili mvina. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Uyangalai kuhika pambila gha lipindi lya lupepu. Wangukujambusa Ebulo na Pude na Linusi na Kilaudio na walongo waghangi wogha. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Bambu aweli pamonga na mweni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">na manemu ghaki yaweli pamonga na mwenga.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>